Subject: [PATCH 1/5] docs(M3): record per-seed wall-clock decision before H3.2

RunManifest.wall_clock_s has existed since M1/M2, but cli.py::_solve only
calls store_run once per whole solve invocation. M4/M5 both require
equal-wall-clock comparisons across >=5 seeds, and H3.2 itself calls for
five SA seeds each recorded as its own run -- recorded as an explicit
decision before any SA code is written, so it doesn't start happening
silently partway through the milestone.
